    "Fluxo's library file is damaged and can't be read. You can start with an empty library: the damaged one is kept on this Apple TV." : {
      "comment" : "Apple TV library recovery screen: explanation when the library file is damaged (there is no export on Apple TV).",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
