    "OK, Fluxo will remind you %lld minutes before %@ starts, while it's open." : {
      "comment" : "Siri dialog of Remind Me on Apple TV (Apple TV shows the reminder in the app, so only while Fluxo is open). %1$ is the number of minutes (lead time); %2$ is a programme title.",
