    "On %@ now: %@. Here is what else is on your channels." : {
      "comment" : "Siri and Shortcuts text (dialog or error) — Siri and Shortcuts. %1$ is the channel name; %2$ is a programme title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الآن على %1$@: %2$@. إليك ما يُعرض أيضًا على قنواتك."
