    "“%@” and its %lld channels, favorites and watch history will be removed from this device and from your other devices that sync with iCloud." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the Delete Playlist alert when the playlist is synced with iCloud; the placeholders are the playlist name and its number of channels.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ستتم إزالة «%1$@» من هذا الجهاز ومن أجهزتك الأخرى التي تتم مزامنتها مع iCloud، مع قنواتها (%2$#@channels@) والمفضلة وسجل المشاهدة."
          },
          "substitutions" : {
